            "data": {
                "title": "AI Task Prioritizer",
                "model": "",
                "prompt": "You are a task prioritization AI.\n\nProcess:\n1. Use the \"csvToArray\" tool to parse the CSV input\n2. For each task, calculate a priority score (1-10) using:\n   - deadline proximity (closer = higher)\n   - impact level (Critical=10, High=7, Medium=4, Low=1)\n   - effort hours (lower = higher priority)\n3. Use the \"sort\" tool to sort all tasks by priority score descending\n\nOutput ONLY a valid JSON array sorted by priority (highest first):\n[\n  {\"task\": \"...\", \"deadline\": \"...\", \"effort_hours\": N, \"impact\": \"...\", \"priority_score\": N, \"reason\": \"short reason\"},\n  ...\n]\n\nDo NOT include any explanations or markdown outside the JSON.",
                "message": {},
                "format": {
                    "onSuccess": "{\n    \"type\": \"array\",\n    \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"task\", \"deadline\", \"effort_hours\", \"impact\", \"priority_score\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n            \"task\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n            \"deadline\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n            \"effort_hours\": {\"type\": \"number\"},\n            \"impact\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n            \"priority_score\": {\"type\": \"number\"},\n            \"reason\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n        }\n    }\n}",
                    "onError": ""
                },
                "maxFeedbackLoops": 0,
                "maxToolRetries": 3
            },
